<title>SPAIN: Spain's June trade deficit 215 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain's June trade deficit 215 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The customs department of the economy ministry gave the following figures (billions of pesetas):</p>
<p> TRADE BALANCE	     JUN 96	 MAY 96	 JUN 95</p>
<p> Exports		    1,100.7	1,164.1	  988.2</p>
<p> Imports		    1,315.7	1,433.4	1,236.5</p>
<p> Deficit/surplus	   -215.0	 -269.3	 -248.3</p>
<p> Deficit yr to date    -1,334.0     -1,119.0     -1,420.9</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are customs-cleared data.  </p>
<p> TRADE BALANCE (EU)	JUN 96	 MAY 96	 JUN 95</p>
<p> Exports			790.0	  851.0	  721.2</p>
<p> Imports			879.3	  946.5	  831.6</p>
<p> Deficit/surplus	    -89.3	 -95.5	 -110.4</p>
<p> Def/surplus yr to date  -399.0	 -309.7	 -493.0</p>
</text>
